  "body": "Recently upgraded with double glazed windows and a heat pump for year-round comfort, this beautifully maintained single level weatherboard home combines modern convenience, generous proportions and relaxed coastal living.    \r\n\r\nNestled in a peaceful pocket of Red Beach, the home has been thoughtfully designed with families in mind. Generous proportions and seamless indoor-outdoor flow create an environment where everyone can enjoy their own space while still coming together at the heart of the home. \r\n\r\nAt the centre of the home is a modern open plan kitchen that connects effortlessly with the dining and living areas, creating a welcoming hub for everyday family life and entertaining. Attractive timber flooring adds warmth and style, while large windows allow natural light to fill the living spaces throughout the day. A separate lounge provides valuable flexibility for growing families, children's activities, enjoying a movie night or simply relaxing at the end of the day. \r\n\r\nOutside, the fully fenced section offers privacy and peace of mind, with two separate deck areas providing the perfect setting for summer barbecues, alfresco dining or relaxing in the sunshine. There's ample space for children and pets to play safely while adults unwind.     \r\n\r\nBeyond the property itself, the lifestyle on offer is truly special. Located just minutes from both Red Beach and Orewa Beach, you'll enjoy easy access to beautiful coastlines, swimming, walking tracks, parks, cafés and restaurants, making it easy to embrace the relaxed coastal lifestyle that the Hibiscus Coast is renowned for. \r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n• Four double bedrooms, including a master with ensuite\r\n• Two bathrooms\r\n• Spacious open plan kitchen, dining and living area\r\n• Separate family lounge\r\n• Double glazed windows\r\n• Heat pump\r\n• Separate laundry\r\n• Double internal access garage\r\n• Fully fenced section\r\n• Two outdoor entertaining decks\r\n• Approx. 205m² floor area on a 634m² freehold section (more or less)\r\n\r\nConveniently located near Silverdale Shopping Centre, medical facilities, Northern Arena and motorway access, with zoning for Red Beach School and Orewa College, this is an outstanding opportunity to secure a quality family home in a highly desirable coastal location.\r\n\r\nMove in, unpack and start enjoying the lifestyle you've been dreaming of. Contact us for a private viewing today.",
